{"4132240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Path of the Runecaster", "steam_appid": 4132240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The Path of the Runecaster</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to become the greatest of all Runecasters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your runes to face massive hordes of enemies and survive long enough to reach the stage boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won't be easy, but I’m sure you love a good challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132240/extras/9096e509e17ea0ff24069743942688ea.poster.avif?t=1780864428\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132240/extras/9096e509e17ea0ff24069743942688ea.webm?t=1780864428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132240/extras/9096e509e17ea0ff24069743942688ea.mp4?t=1780864428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Your Arsenal</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true Runecaster can control up to 9 different magical elements, and mastering them all is essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 unique basic attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >36 runes with distinct abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All runes can ascend once they reach level 10, gaining a powerful secret effect!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Tons of Upgrades!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the gold you collect during stages to unlock new runes and upgrade your stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132240/extras/d98e30c94f2799ebcee2a78e0a2c2616.poster.avif?t=1780864428\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132240/extras/d98e30c94f2799ebcee2a78e0a2c2616.webm?t=1780864428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132240/extras/d98e30c94f2799ebcee2a78e0a2c2616.mp4?t=1780864428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The Path of the Runecaster</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey to become the greatest of all Runecasters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your runes to face massive hordes of enemies and survive long enough to reach the stage boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won't be easy, but I’m sure you love a good challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132240/extras/9096e509e17ea0ff24069743942688ea.poster.avif?t=1780864428\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132240/extras/9096e509e17ea0ff24069743942688ea.webm?t=1780864428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132240/extras/9096e509e17ea0ff24069743942688ea.mp4?t=1780864428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Your Arsenal</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A true Runecaster can control up to 9 different magical elements, and mastering them all is essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 unique basic attacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >36 runes with distinct abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All runes can ascend once they reach level 10, gaining a powerful secret effect!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Tons of Upgrades!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend the gold you collect during stages to unlock new runes and upgrade your stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132240/extras/d98e30c94f2799ebcee2a78e0a2c2616.poster.avif?t=1780864428\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132240/extras/d98e30c94f2799ebcee2a78e0a2c2616.webm?t=1780864428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132240/extras/d98e30c94f2799ebcee2a78e0a2c2616.mp4?t=1780864428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Defeat massive hordes of enemies to grow ever more powerful! Unlock new runes and spells to create insane combinations! Gain tons of experience and learn the true meaning of the Runecaster’s path.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, German, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132240/619ed252c1ad0ebb744aa5446f550cdd34905ef6/header.jpg?t=1780864428", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132240/195ddf525e4d01e8d248fe12ecdd4ce525a71c76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780864428", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132240/195ddf525e4d01e8d248fe12ecdd4ce525a71c76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780864428", "website": null